  "scope": "UART full duplex (2 controllers), I2C (2 controllers), standard SPI master (FSPI/SPI2 and SPI3; the SPI0/SPI1 flash controllers are not exposed, and SPI3 is single-line only), LEDC channels (8 low-speed channels, no high-speed group), ADC1/ADC2, RMT channels, I2S (1 controller), USB OTG and TWAI. Every RMT channel can be configured as either TX or RX, so RMT direction is not enforced. usb0 models the USB OTG peripheral on the fixed internal PHY pads (D- = GPIO19, D+ = GPIO20); the D+/D- pair must be routed together. The ESP32-S2 has no SDMMC host, no Bluetooth and no Ethernet MAC; the I2S-based Intel 8080 LCD / DVP camera paths, DAC and touch sensor are not modeled. adc2 shares hardware with Wi-Fi.",
